on is now `Iterable[Any]`, with `Iterable` imported from `collections.abc` inside the `TYPE_CHECKING` block.\n- The docstring now says \"Convert an iterable of items\" and `items (Iterable): An iterable of items.`\n\n`.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_lists.py` passes (14 tests). I ran only that command, not the rest of the suite.", "ttft_ms": 2381, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 10227, "uuid": "327f9628-ed00-477f-ab1d-926317a3b588", "ttft_stream_ms": 1636, "time_to_request_ms": 59, "first_content_frame_ms": 1636, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
